nx2alarm — NOTICE

nx2alarm is a fork of nx2android (https://github.com/shirai91/nx2android), which is the
Android port of nxnative (https://github.com/seedds/nxnative). Both are MIT-licensed; the
upstream license text is reproduced in LICENSE and nxnative/LICENSE. The Android target is
kept in this repository; see docs/UPSTREAM_README_nx2android.md for the upstream README.

Upstream projects and the code this fork builds on:

- nx2android (MIT) — Android port, porter pipeline, Android runtime, game profiles, docs.
- nxnative (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 seedds) — the native Switch host engine, HLE, NVN layer,
  rewriter, shader pipeline and the Apple front ends. This repository's nxnative/ tree is the
  nx2android fork of it.
- Ryujinx (MIT) — shader translator (nxnative/dm/third_party/ryujinx) and common code.
- zstd, libvpx, stb_vorbis, Vulkan-Headers, libadrenotools, bcdec, fusion-pixel-font and the
  other bundled third-party components under nxnative/dm/third_party/ keep their own licenses
  and copyright notices.

The Arch Linux ARM platform layer (nxnative/dm/alarm/, docs/ALARM_*.md, docs/PORTING_PLAN.md,
docs/FEASIBILITY.md, docs/M1_VERIFICATION.md) is new in this fork and is released under the
same MIT license as the rest of the project.

No game files, keys or anything extracted from them are included. Do not commit your own
prod.keys or game dumps to this repository.
